    "title": "Full 2026 schedule revealed for East Texas A&M Lion Volleyball - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lion Athletics ,\n23 hours ago COMMERCE — East Texas A&M University volleyball coach Joe Morales has announced the full 2026 season for the Lions. The Lions are slated to host 11 matches this fall on the Hunt Regional Healthcare Court in the Field House, which includes the four-team Lion Invitational to start the season on Aug. 28-30. Read full article",
